# ---- Frontend (Vite) -------------------------------------------------------
# Where the "Ask About My Work" console finds /api/chat and /api/health.
# Leave EMPTY in production: the site and the API are served by the same
# Cloudflare Worker, so same-origin relative URLs are used.
# Set it only when running `vite` on :5173 against `wrangler dev` on :8787:
#   VITE_AGENT_API_URL=http://localhost:8787
VITE_AGENT_API_URL=

# ---- Worker (wrangler) -----------------------------------------------------
# Local-only secrets live in `.dev.vars` (gitignored), not here. Production
# secrets are set with `npx wrangler secret put OPENROUTER_API_KEY`.
# Example .dev.vars:
#   OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...
